**RaoAbdullah.github.io** is the personal engineering portfolio of **Rao Abdullah Nasir**, Computer Engineering senior at Mehran University of Engineering & Technology (MUET), Jamshoro (Class of December 2026). Designed from scratch with modern responsive web standards, it showcases academic coursework, professional software engineering internships, machine learning research, and open-source contributions.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

The portfolio serves as an interactive hub for recruiters, collaborators, and engineering teams to explore:
* **Academic Background & Degree:** B.E. in Computer Engineering from MUET Jamshoro.
* **Internship Experience:** Work delivered during an AI SaaS Product Internship at Technologia Solutions LLC.
* **Featured Projects:** Deep Learning, Geospatial Satellite AI, Systems Programming, and Full-Stack Web Applications.
* **Verified Certifications:** Professional credentials spanning Artificial Intelligence, Python, and Digital Logic Design.

---

## 🏗️ Architecture & Sections

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    subgraph Landing [index.html — Main Hub]
        LOADER[Interactive Letter-Reveal Loader]
        HERO[Hero Section: Availability, Bio & Stats]
        EDU[Education: MUET Jamshoro Degree]
        SKILLS[Technical Capabilities: Languages, Web, Tools]
        FEAT[Featured Projects: Internship & Capstone]
        CERTS[Verified Certifications Showcase]
        CONTACT[Direct Contact Form & Social Links]
        LOADER --> HERO --> EDU --> SKILLS --> FEAT --> CERTS --> CONTACT
    end

    subgraph Catalog [projects.html — Complete Library]
        CAT_HERO[Project Showcase Header]
        ALL_PROJECTS[Categorized Project Cards: AI, Web, Desktop]
        CAT_HERO --> ALL_PROJECTS
    end

    subgraph Design [style.css & script.js]
        THEME[Theme Engine: Light & Dark Modes]
        ANIM[Scroll Reveal & Noise Overlay]
        THEME & ANIM --> Landing & Catalog
    end
```

---

## 🌟 Key Features

* **Multi-Page Web Architecture:**
  * `index.html`: Curated executive overview highlighting core achievements and featured projects.
  * `projects.html`: Comprehensive repository catalog categorizing software, machine learning, web, and hardware builds.
* **Dynamic Dark / Light Theme Engine:**
  * One-click theme toggle switching CSS custom variables (`--bg`, `--text`, `--accent`, `--card-bg`).
  * Persists user theme preference across page visits.
* **Modern Visual & Interactive Aesthetics:**
  * Custom typographic hierarchy featuring Google Fonts: **Syne** (bold geometric headings), **DM Sans** (readable body text), and **JetBrains Mono** (technical badges and metrics).
  * Animated character-by-character page loader (`R-a-o-.-A-b-d-u-l-l-a-h`).
  * Floating dynamic radial color blobs and subtle analog film noise texture.
  * Reveal-on-scroll animations using CSS cubic-bezier timing.
* **Direct Communication Channels:**
  * Direct email trigger (`mailto:abdullahnasirrao7@gmail.com`).
  * Verified links to LinkedIn, GitHub, and social channels.

