## 📂 Repository File Structure

```text
RaoAbdullah.github.io/
├── index.html                 # Main landing page (Hero, Education, Skills, Featured Work, Contact)
├── projects.html              # Full project catalog library
├── script.js                  # Theme switcher, scroll observer, loader, and mobile menu logic
├── style.css                  # Universal stylesheet, theme variables, glassmorphism, animations
├── profile-pic (21).jpeg      # Profile portrait photography
└── README.md                  # Comprehensive project documentation
```

---

## 🚀 Local Development

1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/RaoAbullah/RaoAbdullah.github.io.git
   cd RaoAbdullah.github.io
   ```
2. Open `index.html` directly in your browser, or start a local server:
   ```bash
   python -m http.server 8000
   ```
3. Navigate to `http://localhost:8000` in your web browser.

